"intervals, head to the Results Settings Tab of the given quiz and click on "
"the ^ symbol. Then, write your desired Mailchimp tags. By this, both the "
"contact and the associated tag are added to the Mailchimp list after the "
"quiz, when the user appears in the corresponding interval."
msgstr ""

